9. Those with a history of drug abuse within 12 months prior to screening or those who tested positive for addictive substances before entering the group;
10. Blood loss or blood donation ≥ 200mL within 8 weeks before screening (except for female physiological blood loss);
11. Pregnant and lactating women;
12. Those who cannot tolerate venipuncture blood collection and/or those who have a history of bleeding, acupuncture and/or blood collection vascular conditions are poor;
13. Those who have received the new coronavirus vaccine within 14 days before screening or other vaccines within 3 months before screening, or plan to receive the vaccine during the trial period;
14. The investigator considered it unsuitable to enter this study.

